st reported the threats. A Nato official told CNN on Monday that weapons supplies through PURL were continuing.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/us-threatens-to-cut-ukraine-intelligence-weapons-supplies-over-russian-energy-strikes/articleshow/134898292.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/us-threatens-to-cut-ukraine-intelligence-weapons-supplies-over-russian-energy-strikes/articleshow/134898292.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T22:40:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rajeev Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134899115,imgsize-111680.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Annabel Croft's daughter Lily Coleman marries Felix McCorquodale, relative of Princess Diana, in London]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134898453.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Annabel Croft's daughter Lily Coleman married insurance executive Felix McCorquodale at St Mary's Church in Battersea, London. The bride stunned in two wedding dresses, while her husband has a family connection to Princess Diana through her stepmother, Raine McCorquodale. The wedding brought together family and friends for an emotional celebration filled with flowers, music and dancing.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/annabel-crofts-daughter-lily-coleman-marries-felix-mccorquodale-an-insurance-executive-and-relative-of-princess-diana-in-london-bride-stuns-in-two-wedding-dresses/articleshow/134898453.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/annabel-crofts-daughter-lily-coleman-marries-felix-mccorquodale-an-insurance-executive-and-relative-of-princess-diana-in-london-bride-stuns-in-two-wedding-dresses/articleshow/134898453.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T22:16:13+05:30</