<![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/nearly-four-years-after-engineers-rated-coconut-islands-only-pedestrian-bridge-in-serious-condition-an-8000-pound-county-excavator-helped-collapse-it-hawaii-now-faces-up-to-22-million-to-restore-access/articleshow/134893540.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T20:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134893576,imgsize-668043.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Amelia Earhart mystery: Team heads to remote Pacific island to investigate possible plane wreckage]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134894182.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A group of adept marine archaeologists is gearing up for an intriguing exploration in the lagoon at Nikumaroro Island. This five-day expedition aims to uncover whether a mysterious object discovered there is linked to Amelia Earhart's vanished aircraft. With an array of modern equipment at their disposal, they hope to shed light on decades of speculation surrounding her disappearance and the island's enigmatic connection to her fate.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-17-member-900000-expedition-set-out-on-an-830-nautical-mile-voyage-to-nikumaroro-to-inspect-a-submerged-object-seen-in-satellite-images-five-days-of-sonar-magnetometer-and-dredging-could-test-an-amelia-earhart-theory/articleshow/134894182.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-17-member-900000-expedition-set-out-on-an-830-nautical-mile-voyage-to-nikumaroro-to-inspect-a-submerged-object-seen-in-satellite-images-five-days-of-sonar-magnetometer-and-dredging-could-test-an-amelia-earhart-theory/articleshow/134894182.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T18:46:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134894327,imgsize-1341302.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Kris Krohn lists Utah estate with a disappearing pool]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134894475.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Kris Krohn has listed his expansive mansion in Utah for $13.95 million. This sprawling estate features a unique hydraulic indoor pool that transforms into a ballroom. The property also includes a commercial-grade gym, spa facilities, and an extensive garage for car collections. The mansion is designed for full-time living and hosting large events. It is expected to attract entrepreneurs and high-level professionals looking for a versatile space.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-2017-youtube-star-and-real-estate-investor-kris-krohn-commissioned-a-utah-estate-the-28446-sq-ft-compound-is-now-listed-for-13-95-million-featuring-a-hydraulic-indoor-pool-that-transforms-into-a-column-free-ballroom/articleshow/134894475.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-2017-youtube-star-and-real-estate-investor-kris-krohn-commissioned-a-utah-estate-the-28446-sq-ft-compound-is-now-listed-for-13-95-million-featuring-a-hydraulic-indoor-pool-that-transforms-into-a-column-free-ballroom/articleshow/134894475.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T19:10:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134894595,imgsize-207474.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Kansas couple sought $550,000 over wedding venue sprinkler rules; appeals court revives one claim]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134891636.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A Kansas couple who planned to build a wedding venue sought more than $550,000 in damages after a two-year construction delay and changes to local building rules led to a dispute over sprinkler requirements. The Kansas Court of Appeals has now revived their equal protection claim against Leavenworth County while upholding the dismissal of their other claims.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2020-a-kansas-couple-received-a-permit-for-a-wedding-venue-without-sprinklers-after-a-two-year-delay-and-a-code-change-they-claimed-more-than-550000-in-losses-and-an-appeals-court-has-revived-one-claim/articleshow/134891636.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2020-a-kansas-couple-received-a-permit-for-a-wedding-venue-without-sprinklers-after-a-two-year-delay-and-a-code-change-they-claimed-more-than-550000-in-losses-and-an-appeals-court-has-revived-one-claim/articleshow/134891636.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T19:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134891901,imgsize-212612.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 1967, Martin Luther King Jr. preached at Shiloh Baptist Church; now it has a $750,000 grant]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134894648.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Shiloh Baptist Church in Cleveland has secured a $750,000 grant to enhance its historic building. The funding aims to improve accessibility and support ongoing community services. Planned repairs include restoring the portico and addressing water damage throughout the church. This grant connects the church's rich history in civil rights activism to its future role in the community. The church aims to remain a vibrant space for worship and community engagement.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1967-martin-luther-king-jr-preached-at-clevelands-shiloh-baptist-church-the-historic-congregation-now-has-a-750000-grant-to-repair-its-building-and-improve-access-for-the-community/articleshow/134894648.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1967-martin-luther-king-jr-preached-at-clevelands-shiloh-baptist-church-the-historic-congregation-now-has-a-750000-grant-to-repair-its-building-and-improve-access-for-the-community/articleshow/134894648.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T19:03:23+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134894739,imgsize-2094454.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mamdani directs NYPD to review use-of-force policy after officer involved in teen’s fatal shooting retires]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134896370.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mamdani-directs-nypd-to-review-use-of-force-policy-after-officer-involved-in-teens-fatal-shooting-retires/articleshow/134896370.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mamdani-directs-nypd-to-review-use-of-force-policy-after-officer-involved-in-teens-fatal-shooting-retires/articleshow/134896370.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T20:41:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134896590,imgsize-79858.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US agents raid lawmaker Ilhan Omar's home as part of immigration fraud probe]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="mar